Output helix-claude.gif

Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1600
Set Height 900
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.0
Set Shell zsh

Hide
Type "source ~/.zshrc 2>/dev/null; clear"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Show

Type "cd ~/code/anansi"
Enter
Sleep 500ms

Type "zellij --layout helix-claude"
Enter
Sleep 5s

Space
Type "f"
Sleep 600ms
Type "pipeline.service"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 2s

Space
Type "s"
Sleep 600ms
Type "complete"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
